<main class="wrap">
  <h1>Black hole to the open sea, one continuous take</h1>
  <p class="sub">As NASA's band of light flattens, the sun or the moon rises out of it in the same shot, and keeps rising while the camera pulls back and the open sea comes up. By day it rises as the sun, by night as the moon, picked from your local time.</p>

